# Experimental Symbol Literals

The set of mathematical lower case bold italic roman letters are symbol literals for the ordinary characters they represent.

The symbolic character literals are:
𝒂 𝒃 𝒄 𝒅 𝒆 𝒇 𝒈 𝒉 𝒊 𝒋 𝒌 𝒍 𝒎 𝒏 𝒐 𝒑 𝒒 𝒓 𝒔 𝒕 𝒖 𝒗 𝒘 𝒙 𝒚 𝒛

The names of these symbols are their ordinary non-italic counterparts:

~~~spl experimental
𝒙.name
'x'
~~~
